lines=['# V02 acceptance — circulation milestone','', 'Full V02 completion is **not established**. All three destination approaches now have full normal-input traces, and public circulation reachesY128 and returns to ground. Service-yard combat and the market rescue now have playable prototypes and lifecycle input evidence. Transit pursuit also has chase/interception/escape/lifecycle evidence; broader recovery, final architecture, world life, visuals and sustained performance remain open.','',f'Candidate: `{entry.name}` (`{eh}`).','', '## Named gameplay gates','', '| Gate | Status | Evidence and remaining scope |','|---|---|---|','| A/B/C city loops | PASS | Three complete loops, grounded, ordinary keys, no powers; one controlled start per loop. |','| D station approaches | PASS sampled approaches | Public, momentum and mastery each reach the same station goal from ground. Wider alternate input/failure routes remain separate. |','| E depletion | PASS tested variants | Public zero bank; momentum zero/full with no release; mastery zero with no release and full-bank variant with one real brake. |','| F Threadrail | PASS sampled V02 transfer | Four physical casts create two rails; actual R transfers mid-span, followed by Pop and a supported recovery landing. Broader failure routes remain separate. |','| G recovery | PARTIAL | Short catch safely returns to upper deck and descends throughY118/Y108 roofs. An actual no-Pop endpoint returns to the upper deck. Missed anchors and broader overshoots remain open. |','| H camera | PARTIAL | Route camera traces and actual captures exist; full obstruction/contact and touch-size traversal review remains open. |','| I train | NOT TESTED | Real moving front preserved provisionally; full carriage/traffic sweeps remain open. |','| J preservation | PARTIAL | Protected entry hash, original mesh references, impact-owner regression and preserved carving tested. Full missions/combat/destruction playthrough regressions remain open. |','', '## Service-yard gameplay','',*['- '+r['name'] for r in service['results']],*['- '+r['name'] for r in lifecycle['results']],'- These are local controlled-start cases. They do not certify all Echo interactions, final camera/readability, physical devices or the other encounters. Prototype opponent art remains deliberate during graybox acceptance.','','## Suspended-market rescue','',*['- '+r['name'] for r in market['public']['results']],*['- '+r['name'] for r in market['lifecycle']['results']],f"- Full ground-to-extraction input time: {market['public']['secondsToExtraction']:.2f}s; local southern variant: {market['south']['secondsToExtraction']:.2f}s. These are different starts, not a route-speed comparison. Both use no Drive releases and preserve the original courier mission.",'- Civilian bases and physical footprint support are tested. Existing scenic models remain prototypes; final foot poses, contact presentation and camera readability are not certified here.','','## Current measured behavior','']
